span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">학생 개별적으로 연락함&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">5. 문의부서 : 공학교육혁신센터(478-7899) </span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 145%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 145%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 145%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 145%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 145%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">2011. 10. 17.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 145%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 145%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;HY동녘M&quot;\">공학교육혁신센터소장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
